"The Master Core is a sphere two metres wide, of every hue, made from the life of a whole empire."
"The Master Core replenishes itself without end: a planet in one's pocket."
"The Master Core has a hard-wired lock: \"Master Core absolute override: imperial authority\"."
"The Reforged Crown of Harrak serves as the credential for that override."
"A drawer from the Master Core can take only the colors she can wield."
"Nous-blessed stones are anchors for something vast; Nous rages when outlanders break them."
